        "text": "I would like to buy a train ticket to Hue, please."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "Certainly. When would you like to travel?"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "This Saturday morning, if possible."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "There is a train at eight thirty that arrives at noon."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "Could you recommend a good hotel near the old city?"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "Yes, the Heritage Hotel is close to all the attractions."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "I will confirm my hotel reservation tonight."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "Safe travels. Enjoy your visit to Hue!"
      }
    ]
